[177.733302, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[177.733335, "o", "```\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[177.733363, "o", "> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[177.733387, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[177.733428, "o", "### Validation:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[177.733456, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[177.733485, "o", "```python\r\n"]
[177.733514, "o", "\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[177.733538, "o", "> "]
[177.733576, "o", "import pandas as pd\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[177.733604, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[177.733765, "o", "df = pd.read_parquet('/home/user/data/features.parquet')\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[177.733787, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[177.733822, "o", "> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[177.733846, "o", "> "]
[177.734003, "o", "print(f\"Shape: {df.shape}\")           # (50000, 100) ✓\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[177.734026, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[177.734051, "o", "> "]
[177.734169, "o", "print(f\"Min: {df.values.min()}\")      # 0.0 ✓\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[177.734193, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[177.734216, "o", "> "]
[177.734355, "o", "print(f\"Max: {df.values.max()}\")      # 0.7998 < 1.0 ✓\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[177.734385, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[177.734528, "o", "print(f\"NaN: {df.isna().any().any()}\") # False ✓\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[177.734556, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[177.734581, "o", "```\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[177.734604, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[177.734632, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[177.734664, "o", "---\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[177.734691, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[177.734714, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[177.734742, "o", "## Usage\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[177.734771, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[177.734801, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[177.734872, "o", "### Run Fixed Pipeline:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[177.734901, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[177.734926, "o", "```bash\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[177.734976, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[177.73504, "o", "cd /home/user/pipeline\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[177.735069, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[177.735124, "o", "bash run_fixed.sh\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[177.735152, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[177.735181, "o", "```\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[177.735209, "o", "> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[177.735237, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[177.735264, "o", "### Files:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[177.735293, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[177.735522, "o", "- `coordinator_fixed.py` - Fixed coordinator with registration & global vocabulary\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[177.735543, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[177.735571, "o", "> "]
[177.735722, "o", "- `worker_fixed.py` - Fixed worker using transform() only\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[177.735746, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[177.73577, "o", "> "]
[177.735881, "o", "- `run_fixed.sh` - Launcher for fixed pipeline\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[177.735904, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[177.735928, "o", "> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[177.735975, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> ---\r\n"]
[177.736001, "o", "\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[177.736024, "o", "> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[177.736053, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[177.736082, "o", "> "]
[177.73611, "o", "## Key Lessons\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[177.736138, "o", "> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[177.736162, "o", "> "]
[177.736372, "o", "1. **Distributed systems need explicit synchronization** - Don't assume timing\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[177.736396, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[177.73642, "o", "> "]
[177.736614, "o", "2. **Shared state must be explicit** - Each worker needs the same vocabulary\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[177.736639, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[177.736663, "o", "> "]
[177.73685, "o", "3. **Validate completeness** - Track what you expect vs. what you receive\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[177.73688, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[177.737097, "o", "4. **Test at scale** - Small test sets hide race conditions and data loss\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[177.737125, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[177.737353, "o", "5. **Silent failures are the worst** - Add explicit validation and error checking\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[177.737379, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[177.737407, "o", "> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[177.737431, "o", "> ---\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[177.737465, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[177.737494, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[177.737537, "o", "## Performance\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[177.737566, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[177.737594, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[177.73762, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[177.737784, "o", "The fixed pipeline maintains the distributed performance benefits:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[177.737807, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[177.737831, "o", "> "]
[177.737939, "o", "- Single-threaded: ~60 seconds for 50k rows\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[177.737985, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[177.738125, "o", "- Distributed (3 workers): ~15 seconds for 50k rows\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[177.738147, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[177.738171, "o", "> "]
[177.738267, "o", "- **4x speedup with correct results!**\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[177.738291, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[177.738315, "o", "> EOF\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[177.739507, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[177.739534, "o", "I have no name!@8d9b8d08258a:~$ "]
[200.21232, "i", "cat > /home/user/README.md << 'EOF'\n# Distributed TF-IDF Feature Extraction - FIXED\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### Run the FIXED pipeline (recommended):\n```bash\ncd /home/user/pipeline\nbash run_fixed.sh\n```\n\n### Output:\n- `/home/user/data/features.parquet` - 50,000 rows × 100 features\n- All tf-idf values in valid range [0, 1]\n- No missing data, no duplicates\n\n## What Was Fixed\n\nThe original pipeline had 4 critical bugs:\n\n1. **Race condition** - Chunks sent before workers connected → data loss\n2. **Independent vocabularies** - Each worker fit its own vocabulary → incompatible features\n3. **Timeout-based completion** - Stopped after 5s timeout → missing results\n4. **No chunk tracking** - Used list instead of dict → couldn't detect missing/duplicate chunks\n\n### Result: Only 12k/50k rows with invalid tf-idf scores > 1.0\n\n## The Fix\n\n1. **Worker registration** - Coordinator waits for all workers before sending\n2. **Global vocabulary** - Built once on all data, shared with workers\n3. **Explicit tracking** - Dict-base"]
[200.212439, "i", "d result collection, verifies all chunks received\n4. **Graceful termination** - Workers exit cleanly on signal\n\n### Result: All 50k rows with valid tf-idf scores ≤ 1.0\n\n## Files\n\n### Fixed (Use These):\n- `coordinator_fixed.py` - Fixed coordinator\n- `worker_fixed.py` - Fixed worker  \n- `run_fixed.sh` - Launcher for fixed pipeline\n\n### Original (Broken):\n- `coordinator.py` - Original buggy coordinator\n- `worker.py` - Original buggy worker\n- `run.sh` - Original launcher (produces wrong results)\n\n### Reference:\n- `single.py` - Single-threaded reference implementation (slow but correct)\n\n## Detailed Documentation\n\nSee `BUG_REPORT_AND_FIX.md` for:\n- Detailed bug analysis\n- Code-level explanations\n- Before/after comparisons\n- Performance metrics\nEOF\n"]
[200.212487, "o", "cat > /home/user/README.md << 'EOF'\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[200.212543, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
