[200.213028, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[200.213053, "o", "```bash\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[200.213082, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[200.213146, "o", "cd /home/user/pipeline\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[200.213175, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[200.213229, "o", "bash run_fixed.sh\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[200.213259, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[200.213287, "o", "```\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[200.213327, "o", "> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[200.213365, "o", "> "]
[200.2134, "o", "### Output:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[200.213427, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[200.213453, "o", "> "]
[200.213708, "o", "- `/home/user/data/features.parquet` - 50,000 rows × 100 features\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[200.213735, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[200.213764, "o", "> "]
[200.213921, "o", "- All tf-idf values in valid range [0, 1]\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[200.213976, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[200.214109, "o", "- No missing data, no duplicates\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[200.214138, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[200.214168, "o", "> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[200.214201, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[200.214263, "o", "## What Was Fixed\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[200.214293, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[200.214324, "o", "> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[200.214356, "o", "> "]
[200.214506, "o", "The original pipeline had 4 critical bugs:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[200.214534, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[200.214565, "o", "> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[200.214597, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[200.214882, "o", "1. **Race condition** - Chunks sent before workers connected → data loss\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[200.214913, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[200.21494, "o", "> "]
[200.215287, "o", "2. **Independent vocabularies** - Each worker fit its own vocabulary → incompatible features\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[200.215321, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[200.215352, "o", "> "]
[200.215549, "o", "3. **Timeout-based completion** - Stopped after 5s timeout → missing results\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[200.215582, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[200.21586, "o", "4. **No chunk tracking** - Used list instead of dict → couldn't detect missing/duplicate chunks\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[200.215891, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[200.215919, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[200.215962, "o", "> "]
[200.216121, "o", "### Result: Only 12k/50k rows with invalid tf-idf scores > 1.0\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[200.216157, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[200.216188, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[200.216219, "o", "## The Fix\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[200.216256, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[200.216284, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[200.216489, "o", "1. **Worker registration** - Coordinator waits for all workers before sending\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[200.216519, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[200.216718, "o", "2. **Global vocabulary** - Built once on all data, shared with workers\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[200.216746, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[200.217006, "o", "3. **Explicit tracking** - Dict-based result collection, verifies all chunks received\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[200.217037, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[200.217205, "o", "4. **Graceful termination** - Workers exit cleanly on signal\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[200.217232, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[200.217268, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[200.217299, "o", "> "]
[200.217429, "o", "### Result: All 50k rows with valid tf-idf scores ≤ 1.0\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[200.217462, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[200.217489, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[200.217518, "o", "## Files\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[200.217554, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[200.217589, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[200.217646, "o", "### Fixed (Use These):\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[200.217674, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[200.217799, "o", "- `coordinator_fixed.py` - Fixed coordinator\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[200.217838, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[200.217937, "o", "- `worker_fixed.py` - Fixed worker  \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[200.21799, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[200.218112, "o", "- `run_fixed.sh` - Launcher for fixed pipeline\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[200.21815, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[200.21817, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
